# VoiceVision Vision Pipeline - describe_and_answer()
# Source: src/voicevision/pipeline.py

describe_and_answer(image_data, question):
1. Vision: MoondreamBackend.describe(image_data, prompt=question)
2. LLM: Generates response based on description + question
3. Filter: Strips reasoning traces
4. TTS: Synthesizes response (unless muted)

MoondreamBackend (src/voicevision/backends/vision.py):
- Uses GGUF model via llama.cpp subprocess (ADR-001/002)
- Model: moondream2-text-model-f16.gguf + moondream2-mmproj-f16.gguf
- Stateless - no close() needed
- Port 8081 for vision server

Camera backends (src/voicevision/backends/camera.py):
- OpenCV: webcam capture
- Playwright: web page screenshots